Features

Firebase Email/Password authentication

Google Sign-In integration

Fast and clean user interface

Android APK file available for installation

Secure backend authentication using Firebase

Download and Installation

Download the APK from the release section or provided link.

Open the APK file on your Android device.

If prompted, allow installation from unknown sources.

Install and open the Focus app.

If you want, add your direct APK link here:

[Download Focus APK](your-link-here)
Requirements

Android 6.0 or newer

Internet connection required for authentication

Authentication Details

Focus uses Firebase Authentication to ensure secure and reliable login options. Supported login methods:

Email and Password

Google Sign-In

All authentication is handled securely through Firebase services.

Privacy and Security

Passwords are never stored in the app.

Authentication is handled directly by Firebase.

No sensitive information is exposed or shared.

Only essential data required for login is processed.



This repository provides information and documentation for the Focus app. Redistribution or modification of the APK without permission is not allowed.
